    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:pageTextId "concepts-new-class-intro" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:text "A class is a table of the individuals that belong to it." .

talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:concepts-new-relationship-intro a talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:PageTexts ;
    erb:key "concepts-new-relationship-intro" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:pageTextId "concepts-new-relationship-intro" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:text "A relationship is a table of facts, each linking one thing to another. Point its subject or its object at a class to say what kind of thing it must be: the domain and range rule then concludes it." .

talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:concepts-new-values-intro a talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:PageTexts ;
    erb:key "concepts-new-values-intro" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:pageTextId "concepts-new-values-intro" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:text "A value property is a table of facts, each giving a thing a value." .

talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:concepts-new-name a talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:PageTexts ;
    erb:key "concepts-new-name" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:pageTextId "concepts-new-name" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:text "Name: letters and digits, like Concert or performsAt" .

talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:concepts-new-label a talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:PageTexts ;
    erb:key "concepts-new-label" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:pageTextId "concepts-new-label" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:text "Wording on the page, like performs at" .

talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:concepts-add a talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:PageTexts ;
    erb:key "concepts-add" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:pageTextId "concepts-add" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:text "Add" .

talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:concepts-cancel a talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:PageTexts ;
    erb:key "concepts-cancel" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:pageTextId "concepts-cancel" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:text "Cancel" .

talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:concepts-any-thing a talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:PageTexts ;
    erb:key "concepts-any-thing" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:pageTextId "concepts-any-thing" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:text "any thing" .

talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:concepts-a-member a talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:PageTexts ;
    erb:key "concepts-a-member" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:pageTextId "concepts-a-member" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:text "a {class}" .

talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:concepts-role-individuals a talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:PageTexts ;
    erb:key "concepts-role-individuals" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:pageTextId "concepts-role-individuals" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:text "Every individual of the ontology. A class's table lists the ones that belong to it; a property's table says what is true of them." .

talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:concepts-role-class a talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:PageTexts ;
    erb:key "concepts-role-class" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:pageTextId "concepts-role-class" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:text "A class. Each row is an individual that belongs to it: because a fact says so (IsAsserted), or because a property whose subject or object must be a {label} was stated of it." .

talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:concepts-role-relationship a talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:PageTexts ;
    erb:key "concepts-role-relationship" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:pageTextId "concepts-role-relationship" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:text "A relationship between things (an object property). Each row is one fact in effect: {subject} {label} {object}." .

talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:concepts-role-values a talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:PageTexts ;
    erb:key "concepts-role-values" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:pageTextId "concepts-role-values" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:text "A value property (a datatype property). Each row is one fact in effect: {subject} {label} a {datatype} value." .

talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:concepts-role-attributes a talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:PageTexts ;
    erb:key "concepts-role-attributes" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:pageTextId "concepts-role-attributes" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:text "One row per table (ERBTables) and one per field (ERBFields), as the platform's Schema module keeps them. On the row of a class, a property or a column that is a property is what its fields cannot say: its label, its wording on the page, whether it is symmetric, its inverse, chain and disjoint properties. The other columns follow the table or field the row is about." .

talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:concepts-role-support a talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:PageTexts ;
    erb:key "concepts-role-support" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:pageTextId "concepts-role-support" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:text "A table the individuals link to." .

talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:concepts-role-meta a talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:PageTexts ;
    erb:key "concepts-role-meta" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:pageTextId "concepts-role-meta" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:text "Facts about the rulebook itself. The ontology-form row says this is the concept form." .

