    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:label "Interchangeable engines" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:adds "The same page, computed by Postgres views, generated TypeScript or the generated OWL and SHACL rules. Switch with the control above; nothing else changes." ;
