    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:label "Conformance" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:adds "Every engine's answers for the current facts, compared value by value with the conformance harness's own rule for when two values are equal." ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:sortOrder 2 ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:form "ontology" .

