    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:label "The ontology form" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:adds "Every table of the rulebook as an editable grid: rules, properties and their wiring, wording, layouts, the cast. Edits apply at once; Save writes the rulebook file." ;
