    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:label "The concept form" ;
    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:adds "The same ontology as ordinary tables: a table of individuals, a table per class, a table or a column per property, with each property's attributes beside it. Add a person, a class, a relationship or a column there and this page shows it: every edit is written as the matching change of the rulebook's things, properties and statements." ;
